---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import bebe from "./img/bebe.webp?url";
import Ola from '../../components/Ola.astro';
---

<section id="la-historia" class="relative">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-x-12 gap-y-12 px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:gap-x-16 md:gap-y-8"
  >
    <!-- Polaroid image with sticker label -->
    <div
      class="reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-md md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1 md:self-end"
    >
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="polaroid tilt-l1 transition duration-500 hover:rotate-0">
          <img
            src={bebe}
            alt="Bebé en la arena de la playa mirando sonriente el cuento Si los peces hablaran"
            class="block h-auto w-full"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <p
            class="absolute bottom-2 left-0 right-0 text-center font-hand text-4xl leading-none text-azul"
          >
            ¡con realidad aumenta!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal reveal-delay-1 md:col-start-2 md:row-span-2 md:row-start-1 md:self-center"
    >
      <p class="font-hand text-3xl text-arena sm:text-4xl">
        para peques y no tan peques
      </p>
      <h2
        class="mt-2 font-display text-[clamp(2.25rem,6vw,4.5rem)] leading-[0.95]"
      >
        Un cuento que
        <span class="block">
          <Ola class="text-arena">enamora</Ola>
        </span>
        <span class="mt-3 block text-[0.55em] leading-tight text-caparol/85">
          a todas las edades
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed sm:text-xl">
        Si los peces hablaran… narra una historia cautivadora donde el océano
        encuentra su voz y nos descubre el poder de protegerlo.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed sm:text-xl">
        Y ahora también un <strong class="text-arena">cuadernillo de actividades</strong> pensado para conectar con
        diferentes las edades.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed sm:text-xl">
        No te pierdas las aventuras de
        <strong class="font-display text-2xl text-arena">Lorena</strong>,
        <strong class="font-display text-2xl text-arena"
          >Nela la Irritable</strong
        >,
        <strong class="font-display text-2xl text-arena"
          >Dina la Voladora</strong
        >,
        <strong class="font-display text-2xl text-arena">Don Canino</strong>
        y todos sus amigos.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
        <a
          href="/lee-un-fragmento"
          class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-caparol px-6 py-3 font-display text-xl text-caparol transition hover:bg-caparol hover:text-azul sm:text-2xl"
        >
          Leer un fragmento
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
          >
        </a>
        <a
          href="/comprar"
          class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-arena px-6 py-3 font-display text-xl text-negro transition hover:brightness-95 sm:text-2xl"
        >
          Dónde comprarlo
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AR app callout -->
    <div
      class="reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-md md:col-start-1 md:row-start-2 md:self-start"
    >
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-celeste/30 bg-azul/40 p-5 ring-1 ring-caparol/10 backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-6"
      >
        <p class="font-hand text-xl text-arena sm:text-2xl">
          ¡salen del libro!
        </p>
        <p
          class="mt-1 font-display text-lg leading-tight text-caparol sm:text-xl"
        >
          Descarga la app de realidad aumentada
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.benknerit.slph"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="group/store flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-caparol px-4 py-2.5 text-azul shadow-md transition hover:brightness-95"
          >
            <Icon
              name="simple-icons:googleplay"
              class="h-7 w-7"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <span class="flex flex-col leading-tight">
              <span class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-azul/70"
                >disponible en</span
              >
              <span class="font-display text-lg">Google Play</span>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="group/store flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-caparol px-4 py-2.5 text-azul shadow-md transition hover:brightness-95"
          >
            <Icon
              name="simple-icons:appstore"
              class="h-7 w-7"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <span class="flex flex-col leading-tight">
              <span class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-azul/70"
                >disponible en</span
              >
              <span class="font-display text-lg">App Store</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
